{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_30e2c3b458864e1986be5aef","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"5:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2766\">\n    <frame id=\"5:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"5:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"5:5\" name=\"Travelin — travel booking app\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"5:6\" name=\"Design the Travelin mobile app: open the app, start the journey, sign in, and land on a home screen with the upcoming flight, travel categories, recommended journeys and a recommended hotel. Canvas 430 × 932, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"5:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the language selector, the tab bar and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, photos and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"805\">\n      <text id=\"5:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"716\">\n        <frame id=\"5:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"216\">\n          <text id=\"5:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand moment while the app opens.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:18\" name=\"• Brand: Logo_Travelin · tagline “Your Passport to Seamless Adventures!”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"146\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:20\" name=\"→ after delay → 02_Get_Started\" x=\"24\" y=\"172\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:21\" name=\"02_Get_Started\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"5:22\" name=\"02_Get_Started\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"138\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:23\" name=\"Goal: Invite the traveller to start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:25\" name=\"• Action: “Your Journey Starts Here” (Icon_Plane) • Brand: Logo_Travelin • Headline: “Ready to explore beyond boundaries?” • Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down) • Media: Photo_Aerial_Island\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"5:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:27\" name=\"→ Your Journey Starts Here → 03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:28\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"0\" y=\"320\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"5:29\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"97\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:30\" name=\"Goal: Sign in with email / phone or a social account.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:32\" name=\"• Actions: “Forgot password?” · “Sign In” · “Sign Up” • Copy: “Don’t have an account?” · “Discover the World with Every Sign In” · “Let’s Travel you in.” · “or sign in with” • Fields: “Email or Phone Number” · “Password” — both empty • Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down) • Media: Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons • Social sign-in: Apple (Icon_Apple) · Facebook (Icon_Facebook) · Google (Icon_Google)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"5:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:34\" name=\"→ Sign In → 04_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:35\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"320\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"5:36\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"85\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:37\" name=\"Goal: See the upcoming trip and find the next journey.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:39\" name=\"• Account: “Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points (Icon_Coin) · avatar (Photo_Avatar_Cat) • Categories: Bus · Ferry · Flights · Hotels · Trains, each with its icon • Hotels: “Hotel recommendations for you” · See all · Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta (see DATA) • Journeys: “Journey together” · See all · Labengki Sombori · Mount Bromo · Sailing Komodo (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Orders / Deals / Account · current: Home • Search: “Where to go?” (Icon_Search) • Upcoming flight: ticket with status, date, route, times, duration, airline, class, stops and booking ID (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"200\" />\n          <text id=\"5:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"326\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:41\" name=\"→ Home tab: current (no link)\" x=\"24\" y=\"352\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:42\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1407\" width=\"1312\" height=\"139\">\n      <text id=\"5:43\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:44\" name=\"• Launch flow: 01_Splash → (after delay) 02_Get_Started → 03_Sign_In → 04_Home. • 04_Home has a bottom tab bar with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Orders (Icon_Ticket), Deals (Icon_Deals), Account (Icon_Account); current: Home. Only Home is part of this task — how the current tab looks is yours. • Entry only (no frame): language selector, Forgot password?, social sign-in, Sign Up, search, categories, See all, journey and hotel cards, the flight ticket, Orders, Deals, Account.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"88\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:45\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1594\" width=\"1312\" height=\"439\">\n      <text id=\"5:46\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:47\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Prices in USD.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:48\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"350\">\n        <frame id=\"5:49\" name=\"Account\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"5:50\" name=\"Account\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:51\" name=\"“Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points · Photo_Avatar_Cat\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:52\" name=\"Upcoming flight\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"5:53\" name=\"Upcoming flight\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:54\" name=\"Status: Upcoming · 24 March 2024 CGK 05:30 → DPS 08:00 · 1h 30m Sentosa Air · Economy · Direct Booking ID: ZEEBAW (local times — Bali is 1 hour ahead of Jakarta)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:55\" name=\"Journey together (rating · price · duration)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"182\">\n          <text id=\"5:56\" name=\"Journey together (rating · price · duration)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"289\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:57\" name=\"Mount Bromo · Volcano in East Java · ★ 4.9 · Start from $150/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Mount_Bromo) Labengki Sombori · Islands in Sulawesi · ★ 4.8 · Start from $250/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Labengki_Sombori) Sailing Komodo · Labuan Bajo · ★ 4.8 · Start from $200/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Sailing_Komodo)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:58\" name=\"Hotel recommendations for you\" x=\"0\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"5:59\" name=\"Hotel recommendations for you\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:60\" name=\"Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta · 4-star hotel Jl. Sunset Road No. 101, Kuta, Bali, Indonesia $50/night (Photo_Hotel_Room)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:61\" name=\"Categories · tabs\" x=\"444\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"5:62\" name=\"Categories · tabs\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:63\" name=\"Categories: Flights (Icon_Flight) · Hotels (Icon_Hotel) · Trains (Icon_Train) · Ferry (Icon_Ferry) · Bus (Icon_Bus) Tabs: Home · Orders · Deals · Account\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:64\" name=\"Sign-in copy\" x=\"888\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"5:65\" name=\"Sign-in copy\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:66\" name=\"“Let’s Travel you in.” · “Discover the World with Every Sign In” Fields: Email or Phone Number · Password “Forgot password?” · Sign In · “or sign in with” “Don’t have an account?” · Sign Up\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:67\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2081\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"5:68\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:69\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"5:70\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"5:71\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:72\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand colors #007A8C + #336749 and Inter • Media: logo, photos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:73\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"5:74\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:75\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current tab, pressed, focused / filled fields, disabled • Headers, language selector, tab bar, flight ticket, category items, journey and hotel cards, social sign-in buttons • How photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:76\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2421\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"5:77\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:78\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"5:79\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, empty fields, pressed / disabled where shown)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"5:80\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b901ff1-9fdc-48e6-8bc5-70d16984c7d4","uuid":"ab90e308-60a4-431e-9e7a-1cac9761bdb8","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:17:23.730Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"5:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2766\">\n    <frame id=\"5:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"5:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"5:5\" name=\"Travelin — travel booking app\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"5:6\" name=\"Design the Travelin mobile app: open the app, start the journey, sign in, and land on a home screen with the upcoming flight, travel categories, recommended journeys and a recommended hotel. Canvas 430 × 932, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"5:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the language selector, the tab bar and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, photos and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"805\">\n      <text id=\"5:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"716\">\n        <frame id=\"5:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"216\">\n          <text id=\"5:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"90\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand moment while the app opens.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:18\" name=\"• Brand: Logo_Travelin · tagline “Your Passport to Seamless Adventures!”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"146\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:20\" name=\"→ after delay → 02_Get_Started\" x=\"24\" y=\"172\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:21\" name=\"02_Get_Started\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"5:22\" name=\"02_Get_Started\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"138\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:23\" name=\"Goal: Invite the traveller to start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:25\" name=\"• Action: “Your Journey Starts Here” (Icon_Plane) • Brand: Logo_Travelin • Headline: “Ready to explore beyond boundaries?” • Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down) • Media: Photo_Aerial_Island\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"5:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:27\" name=\"→ Your Journey Starts Here → 03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:28\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"0\" y=\"320\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"5:29\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"97\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:30\" name=\"Goal: Sign in with email / phone or a social account.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:32\" name=\"• Actions: “Forgot password?” · “Sign In” · “Sign Up” • Copy: “Don’t have an account?” · “Discover the World with Every Sign In” · “Let’s Travel you in.” · “or sign in with” • Fields: “Email or Phone Number” · “Password” — both empty • Language: “English” (Icon_Chevron_Down) • Media: Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons • Social sign-in: Apple (Icon_Apple) · Facebook (Icon_Facebook) · Google (Icon_Google)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"5:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:34\" name=\"→ Sign In → 04_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:35\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"320\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"5:36\" name=\"04_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"85\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:37\" name=\"Goal: See the upcoming trip and find the next journey.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:39\" name=\"• Account: “Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points (Icon_Coin) · avatar (Photo_Avatar_Cat) • Categories: Bus · Ferry · Flights · Hotels · Trains, each with its icon • Hotels: “Hotel recommendations for you” · See all · Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta (see DATA) • Journeys: “Journey together” · See all · Labengki Sombori · Mount Bromo · Sailing Komodo (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Orders / Deals / Account · current: Home • Search: “Where to go?” (Icon_Search) • Upcoming flight: ticket with status, date, route, times, duration, airline, class, stops and booking ID (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"200\" />\n          <text id=\"5:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"326\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:41\" name=\"→ Home tab: current (no link)\" x=\"24\" y=\"352\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:42\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1407\" width=\"1312\" height=\"139\">\n      <text id=\"5:43\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:44\" name=\"• Launch flow: 01_Splash → (after delay) 02_Get_Started → 03_Sign_In → 04_Home. • 04_Home has a bottom tab bar with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Orders (Icon_Ticket), Deals (Icon_Deals), Account (Icon_Account); current: Home. Only Home is part of this task — how the current tab looks is yours. • Entry only (no frame): language selector, Forgot password?, social sign-in, Sign Up, search, categories, See all, journey and hotel cards, the flight ticket, Orders, Deals, Account.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"88\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:45\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1594\" width=\"1312\" height=\"439\">\n      <text id=\"5:46\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:47\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Prices in USD.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:48\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"350\">\n        <frame id=\"5:49\" name=\"Account\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"5:50\" name=\"Account\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:51\" name=\"“Hi, Paul” · 2,000 points · Photo_Avatar_Cat\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:52\" name=\"Upcoming flight\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"5:53\" name=\"Upcoming flight\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:54\" name=\"Status: Upcoming · 24 March 2024 CGK 05:30 → DPS 08:00 · 1h 30m Sentosa Air · Economy · Direct Booking ID: ZEEBAW (local times — Bali is 1 hour ahead of Jakarta)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:55\" name=\"Journey together (rating · price · duration)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"182\">\n          <text id=\"5:56\" name=\"Journey together (rating · price · duration)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"289\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:57\" name=\"Mount Bromo · Volcano in East Java · ★ 4.9 · Start from $150/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Mount_Bromo) Labengki Sombori · Islands in Sulawesi · ★ 4.8 · Start from $250/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Labengki_Sombori) Sailing Komodo · Labuan Bajo · ★ 4.8 · Start from $200/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Sailing_Komodo)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:58\" name=\"Hotel recommendations for you\" x=\"0\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"5:59\" name=\"Hotel recommendations for you\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:60\" name=\"Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta · 4-star hotel Jl. Sunset Road No. 101, Kuta, Bali, Indonesia $50/night (Photo_Hotel_Room)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:61\" name=\"Categories · tabs\" x=\"444\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"5:62\" name=\"Categories · tabs\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:63\" name=\"Categories: Flights (Icon_Flight) · Hotels (Icon_Hotel) · Trains (Icon_Train) · Ferry (Icon_Ferry) · Bus (Icon_Bus) Tabs: Home · Orders · Deals · Account\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:64\" name=\"Sign-in copy\" x=\"888\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"5:65\" name=\"Sign-in copy\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:66\" name=\"“Let’s Travel you in.” · “Discover the World with Every Sign In” Fields: Email or Phone Number · Password “Forgot password?” · Sign In · “or sign in with” “Don’t have an account?” · Sign Up\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:67\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2081\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"5:68\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:69\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"5:70\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"5:71\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:72\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand colors #007A8C + #336749 and Inter • Media: logo, photos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:73\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"5:74\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:75\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, overlays on photos, status badge, rating, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current tab, pressed, focused / filled fields, disabled • Headers, language selector, tab bar, flight ticket, category items, journey and hotel cards, social sign-in buttons • How photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:76\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2421\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"5:77\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:78\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"5:79\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, empty fields, pressed / disabled where shown)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"5:80\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"d3c20333-ae4f-43c5-a949-7f7ffa21a47f"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_30e2c3b458864e1986be5aef","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
