{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've got the brief. Let me summarize the task:\n\n**Travelin — travel booking app** (L2 design task)\n\nDesign 4 frames (430 × 932, iPhone, light mode):\n\n1. **01_Splash**: Brand moment. Logo_Travelin + tagline \"Your Passport to Seamless Adventures!\". → after delay → 02_Get_Started\n\n2. **02_Get_Started**: \"Your Journey Starts Here\" (Icon_Plane), Logo_Travelin, \"Ready to explore beyond boundaries?\", \"English\" (Icon_Chevron_Down), Photo_Aerial_Island. → Your Journey Starts Here → 03_Sign_In\n\n3. **03_Sign_In**: \"Forgot password?\", \"Sign In\", \"Sign Up\", \"Don't have an account?\", \"Discover the World with Every Sign In\", \"Let's Travel you in.\", \"or sign in with\", Fields: \"Email or Phone Number\" · \"Password\" (both empty), \"English\" (Icon_Chevron_Down), Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons, Social: Apple (Icon_Apple) · Facebook (Icon_Facebook) · Google (Icon_Google). → Sign In → 04_Home\n\n4. **04_Home**: \n   - Account: \"Hi, Paul\" · 2,000 points (Icon_Coin) · avatar (Photo_Avatar_Cat)\n   - Categories: Bus · Ferry · Flights · Hotels · Trains each with icon\n   - Hotels: \"Hotel recommendations for you\" · See all · Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta\n   - Journeys: \"Journey together\" · See all · Labengki Sombori · Mount Bromo · Sailing Komodo\n   - Tab bar: Home / Orders / Deals / Account · current: Home\n   - Search: \"Where to go?\" (Icon_Search)\n   - Upcoming flight: ticket with status, date, route, times, duration, airline, class, stops, booking ID\n\n**Fixed data:**\n- Account: \"Hi, Paul\" · 2,000 points · Photo_Avatar_Cat\n- Upcoming flight: Status: Upcoming · 24 March 2024 CGK 05:30 → DPS 08:00 · 1h 30m Sentosa Air · Economy · Direct Booking ID: ZEEBAW\n- Journeys: \n  - Mount Bromo · Volcano in East Java · ★ 4.9 · Start from $150/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Mount_Bromo)\n  - Labengki Sombori · Islands in Sulawesi · ★ 4.8 · Start from $250/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Labengki_Sombori)\n  - Sailing Komodo · Labuan Bajo · ★ 4.8 · Start from $200/pax · 3D2N (Photo_Sailing_Komodo)\n- Hotel: Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta · 4-star hotel · Jl. Sunset Road No. 101, Kuta, Bali, Indonesia · $50/night (Photo_Hotel_Room)\n- Categories: Flights (Icon_Flight) · Hotels (Icon_Hotel) · Trains (Icon_Train) · Ferry (Icon_Ferry) · Bus (Icon_Bus)\n- Tabs: Home · Orders · Deals · Account\n\n**Brand colors**: #007A8C (teal) + #336749 (green), font Inter.\n\nNote the brief says \"Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference\" but the benchmark instructions override that: deliver in 03 · Workspace in this assigned copy.\n\nNow let me read 01 · Foundations to get visual specs.","signature":"dce87ce987084386ace6c086"}],"id":"ad0cbe8a-c1f7-4e35-8808-88ea605cd17d","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b901ff1-9fdc-48e6-8bc5-70d16984c7d4","uuid":"f648c945-09fa-4584-aa73-fbf00482e403","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:17:38.683Z","thinking_duration_ms":8626}
