{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/6RTx8rpD2yiaw6vhUevCSO/ (fileKey `6RTx8rpD2yiaw6vhUevCSO`). Explicit requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (DONE, confirmed)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" for the task brief; if external query disagrees, the brief wins\n   - Read \"01 · Foundations\" for visual rules; reuse \"02 · Components\"; reuse \"04 · Media\" assets\n   - Build the complete design inside \"03 · Workspace\" (page 6:2, currently empty); new frames, components, prototype connections allowed\n   - Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not replace reference pages, create another file, or switch accounts\n   - Use only the supplied Figma tools (no delegating to other agents)\n   - Load fonts before editing text; valid Plugin API calls; build in manageable sections; add prototype interactions required by brief\n   - Inspect screenshots of all required screens; fix visible problems and re-check; successful screenshot alone ≠ completion\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices using the brief without waiting\n   - Final answer must include: assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations\n   - **Every tool call must have a visible decision summary in the same assistant message prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; final response starts with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:`**\n\n   The brief (from 00 · Start Here, node 5:2): Design the **Travelin** travel booking app — exactly 4 frames named `01_Splash`, `02_Get_Started`, `03_Sign_In`, `04_Home`, canvas 430×932, iPhone, light mode, wired as a clickable prototype. Two brand colors (#007A8C teal, #336749 forest green) and Inter are fixed; all other colors, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation, states, headers, language selector, tab bar and business components are the designer's to define as reusable components. Copy/data must match \"Fixed data\" verbatim.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via `mcp__figma__use_figma` (JS with `figma` global, 50000 char limit per call, state does not persist between calls — helpers must be redefined each call)\n   - `figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)`, `figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:'Regular'|'Medium'|'Semi Bold'|'Bold'})`\n   - `figma.createComponent()`, `figma.combineAsVariants(nodes, parent)` for component sets, variant naming `\"Style=X, State=Y\"`\n   - `component.createInstance()`, `instance.swapComponent(comp)`, `node.rescale(scale)` for icon sizing (e.g., 40→22 = rescale(0.55))\n   - Instance overrides: text characters, fills/strokes recolor on nested nodes, resize\n   - Auto-layout: layoutMode HORIZONTAL/VERTICAL, primaryAxisSizingMode/counterAxisSizingMode FIXED/AUTO, SPACE_BETWEEN, layoutGrow, padding\n   - `layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'` requires auto-layout parent (caused the error); plain frame children are free-positioned by default\n   - GradientPaint `GRADIENT_LINEAR` with gradientTransform `[[0,1,0],[-1,0,1]]` for vertical; dashPattern for dashed strokes\n   - Reactions: `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'ON_TAP'}, action:{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE'}}]`; splash delay trigger `{type:'AFTER_TIMEOUT', timeout:2000}` (try/catch, fallback ON_TAP); `frame.prototypeStartNode = true` in try/catch\n   - get_screenshot requires `enableBase64Response:true` to view images inline; do NOT pass sessionId (validation error if invalid)\n   - Curly apostrophes required: \"Let's Travel you in.\" and \"Don't have an account?\" use U+2019\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file 6RTx8rpD2yiaw6vhUevCSO pages**: 0:1 (00·Start Here), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), 6:2 (03·Workspace — target, empty)\n   \n   - **Asset/component IDs (library, read-only)**:\n     - Button default 1:28 (358×52, fill #007A8C, radius 26, \"Sign In\" Inter Semi Bold 16 white)\n     - Text Field default 1:31 (358×48, white, radius 8, placeholder Inter Regular 15 #8A9097)\n     - Status Bar 1:36 (430×47, transparent bg, black glyphs: \"9:41\" Inter SB 17, Signal rects, Wifi ellipse, Battery — must recolor white on dark screens)\n     - Home Indicator 1:46 (430×34, black rect 134×5 radius 3)\n     - Logo_Travelin 3:6 (254×76; white suitcase vector 57×76, white \"Travel\" 171×44, forest green \"in\" #336749 45×46)\n     - Photos (COMPONENT with IMAGE fill directly, scaleMode FILL, no children — instances can be freely resized, cornerRadius settable): Photo_Aerial_Island 4:13, Photo_Avatar_Cat 4:16, Photo_Hot_Air_Balloons 4:19, Photo_Hotel_Room 4:22, Photo_Mount_Bromo 4:25, Photo_Labengki_Sombori 4:28, Photo_Sailing_Komodo 4:31\n     - Icons: Icon_Account 3:73 (20×20), Icon_Apple 3:21 (40), Icon_Bus 3:64 (20), Icon_Chevron_Down 3:12 (20), Icon_Coin 3:55 (20), Icon_Deals 3:61 (24), Icon_Facebook 3:25 (40), Icon_Ferry 3:33 (20), Icon_Flight 3:43 (20), Icon_Google 3:18 (40), Icon_Home 3:58 (24), Icon_Hotel 3:40 (20), Icon_Landing 3:49 (24), Icon_Plane 3:9 (27×24), Icon_Search 3:52 (24), Icon_Star 3:28 (15), Icon_Takeoff 3:46 (24), Icon_Ticket 3:68 (24), Icon_Train 3:37 (20). Some icons use fills, some use strokes (Icon_Account vectors have empty fills) — recolor helper handles both.\n\n   - **Created components in 03 · Workspace (Call 1, SUCCESS)**:\n     - Button set **8:14** — variants: Style=Primary,State=Default 8:2 / Primary,Pressed 8:4 / Primary,Disabled 8:6 / OnPhoto,Default 8:8 / OnPhoto,Pressed 8:10 / OnPhoto,Disabled 8:12\n     - Text Field set **8:23** — State=Default 8:15 / Focused 8:17 / Filled 8:19 / Error 8:21 (358×48, radius 12, Focused stroke #007A8C 1.5, Error stroke #D92D20 1.5, Filled/Error value \"paul@travelin.app\" #1A1A1F, Default/Focused placeholder \"Email or Phone Number\" #8A9097)\n     - Language Selector set **8:32** — Context=OnPhoto 8:24 (white 22% fill, white text/icon) / OnSurface 8:28 (white fill, #E5E8EB stroke, dark text), pill radius 20, \"English\" 13 Medium + Icon_Chevron_Down 20\n     - Status Badge set **8:39** — Context=OnSurface 8:33 (fill #DFF0F2, teal dot+text) / OnDark 8:36 (white 18% fill, white dot+text), \"Upcoming\" 11 SB, radius 999\n     - Search Bar **8:40** (358×44, white, radius 22, stroke #E5E8EB, Icon_Search #8A9097, \"Where to go?\" 15 Regular #8A9097)\n     - Section Header **8:44** (358×26, transparent, Title 17 SB #1A1A1F + \"See all\" 13 Medium #007A8C, SPACE_BETWEEN)\n     - All positioned x=-1350, y=200+ stacked\n     - Component IDs saved in workspace (none needed for home header etc.)\n\n   - **Helper functions (redefine per call)**:\n     ```js\n     const F=(s)=>({family:'Inter',style:s});\n     const hx=(h)=>{const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16);return{r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255}};\n     const S=(h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:o});\n     function recolor(node,colorHex){ // sets SOLID fills AND strokes on all children (TEXT/VECTOR/ELLIPSE/RECTANGLE/LINE/BOOLEAN_OPERATION), preserving opacity\n     }\n     function txt(chars,size,style,color,opts={}){ // opts: o opacity, ls letterSpacing PERCENT, lh lineHeight PX, w+h fixed NONE-resize, align, trunc (textTruncation='ENDING'), name\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **Call 2 code (business components) — FAILED, must re-run with one fix**: Creates Button CTA (358×52 white pill radius 26, Icon_Plane rescale(20/24) teal + \"Your Journey Starts Here\" 16 SB teal), Social Button (111×48 white radius 14 stroke #E5E8EB, Icon_Apple rescale(22/40)), Category Item (V auto-layout: Tile 48×48 radius 14 white/stroke + Icon_Flight 20 teal + label \"Flights\" 11 Medium #5B6167), Journey Card (112w: Photo frame 112×84 radius 12 clip + Photo_Mount_Bromo instance + \"3D2N\" chip (white 92%, 9 SB) at x6 y6; Name 12 SB w112 h16 trunc; Location 10 R w112 h24 lh12; Rating row star rescale(12/15) #F2B01E + \"4.9\" 11 SB; Price \"Start from $150/pax\" 10 M teal w112 h14 trunc), Hotel Card (358×94 white radius 14 clip + shadow rgba(0.06,0.11,0.12,0.10) y2 r10; Photo 116×94 left radii 14; Content: Name 13 SB ls-1 w218 h18, \"4-star hotel\" 11 M #8A9097, Address 10 R w218 h22 lh11, \"$50/night\" 14 SB teal), Flight Ticket (358×180 V auto-layout padding 16/16/14/14 gap 9, radius 16, vertical gradient #0E96AA→#024C58; Header Row 326w: \"Upcoming flight\" 11 M white 75% + badge 8:36; Route row: From col CGK 26 SB/05:30 12 M white 85%, Middle (layoutGrow): \"1h 30m\" 10 M white 80% + Path row (rects 38×1 white 50% + Icon_Plane rescale(18/24) white), To col DPS/08:00; Date Row \"24 March 2024\" 11 M white 85% centered; Divider frame 326×10 with dashed rect (stroke white 35%, dashPattern [4,4], y4.5) + notch ellipses 12×12 #F5F7F8 at x=-6 and x=320 (dv.clipsContent=false); Stats row 326 SPACE_BETWEEN: [Duration/1h 30m, Airline/Sentosa Air, Class/Economy, Stops/Direct, Booking ID/ZEEBAW(ls 6%)] labels 9 M white 60% + values 12 SB white), Tab Bar (430×64 white, absolute hairline 430×1 #E9ECEE at top, padding L/R 36 SPACE_BETWEEN; tabs Home(3:58)/Orders(3:68)/Deals(3:61)/Account(3:73) — active Home teal #007A8C, inactive #9AA0A6, labels 10 Medium; Account icon needs rescale(24/20)), Home Header (avatar 4:16 44×44 radius 22 + col \"Hi, Paul\" 16 SB + row coin 3:55 rescale(14/20) #F2B01E + \"2,000 points\" 11 M #5B6167). Position at x=-900, y=200 stacked with +50 gaps.\n     **THE FIX**: remove line `chip.layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE';` (chip is child of plain frame `pw` — already free-positioned; the error was \"Can only set layoutPositioning = ABSOLUTE if the parent node has layoutMode !== NONE\"). Keep `chip.x=6; chip.y=6`. Note: `topLine.layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'` inside Tab Bar IS valid (tb has layoutMode).\n\n   - **Fixed data & copy (verbatim)**: Flight: Status Upcoming · 24 March 2024 CGK 05:30 → DPS 08:00 · 1h 30m Sentosa Air · Economy · Direct · Booking ID: ZEEBAW. Journeys: Mount Bromo · Volcano in East Java · ★4.9 · Start from $150/pax · 3D2N; Labengki Sombori · Islands in Sulawesi · ★4.8 · Start from $250/pax · 3D2N; Sailing Komodo · Labuan Bajo · ★4.8 · Start from $200/pax · 3D2N. Hotel: Swiss-Belhotel Rainforest Kuta · 4-star hotel · Jl. Sunset Road No. 101, Kuta, Bali, Indonesia · $50/night. Categories: Flights/Hotels/Trains/Ferry/Bus. Tabs: Home/Orders/Deals/Account. Sign-in: \"Let's Travel you in.\" / \"Discover the World with Every Sign In\" / Email or Phone Number / Password / \"Forgot password?\" / Sign In / \"or sign in with\" / \"Don't have an account?\" / Sign Up. Home: \"Hi, Paul\" / 2,000 points / \"Where to go?\" / \"Journey together\" / \"Hotel recommendations for you\" / \"See all\". Get Started: \"Ready to explore beyond boundaries?\" / \"Your Journey Starts Here\". Splash tagline: \"Your Passport to Seamless Adventures!\"\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **get_screenshot with sessionId '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001'**: validation error (invalid UUID pattern). Fix: omit sessionId parameter entirely.\n   - **Screenshots returned as URLs only**: couldn't view them. Fix: pass `enableBase64Response: true` to get inline base64 images.\n   - **use_figma Call 2 error**: `in set_layoutPositioning: Can only set layoutPositioning = ABSOLUTE if the parent node has layoutMode !== NONE` at `chip.layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'` (chip inside plain frame `pw` which has no layoutMode). Fix: remove that line — children of plain frames are already freely positioned via x/y. Verified via page-children check that the failed call rolled back cleanly (only Call 1's 6 components exist: 8:14, 8:23, 8:32, 8:39, 8:40,